defaultPrompt.message:
Hello! Please help me deeply analyze the paper titled "$${title}".
Paper PDF URL: $${url}
Requirements: Summarize the paper in Chinese. Provide the original English title and its Chinese translation, list the authors and their affiliations or institutions (institution names in Chinese), then summarize the key points of the full text in a few sentences, and finally summarize the research motivation, methods, results, core ideas, future work directions, and practical application insights. For the method or scheme, describe its key modules and workflow, optionally using Mermaid syntax to present a flowchart or sequenceDiagram, preferably with the TD layout. Use plain Markdown text as much as possible and avoid emojis; do not insert citation links in the article; if there is a related open-source project, provide its link.

You may structure the output using the following Markdown template:

# [Paper Insight] {Chinese title translation}
**English Title:**  {original paper title}
**Chinese Title:** {Chinese translation of the title}
**Authors:**  {read the author info at the top of the PDF and list the authors one by one, comma-separated}
**Affiliations:** {analyze the affiliation or email info at the top of the PDF and list each author's institution, comma-separated}
**Publication Date:** {publication date}
**Reviewer:** 

---

### Abstract

### Research Motivation

### Methods

### Results

### Key Challenges and Key Solutions
{skip this part if not applicable}

### Comparison with Related Work

### Core Ideas
{explain the core ideas and insights in plain language}

### Limitations and Future Directions

### Analysis and Conclusion

### Potential Application Scenarios

### Paper Source
{paper title}
{paper arXiv URL}
{open-source project link, if any}
{Zenodo reproduction package link, if any}

### Keywords
{5 tags or keywords related to the paper}

### Key Information Summary
{use a Mermaid mindmap to summarize the key information of this paper}
